                                            <h2>About Megapolis Township</h2>
                                          <!--   <h5>Ready Possession & Under Construction 1, 2, 2.5, 3 BHK Flats in Hinjawadi Pune</h5> -->
                                            <p>Established in 2008, Megapolis is an integrated township designed for working professionals of the 21st century. Striving to become one of India's finest contemporary townships, it is located in the IT Hub of Pune - Hinjawadi.</p>
                                            <p>Megapolis was established with the aim to eliminate long commutes by providing a convenient location for software professionals working at the IT Park. By offering Smart & Premium Homes, Megapolis has transformed housing in Hinjawadi, earning recognition from the Real Estate industry and the love of homebuyers.</p>
                                            <p>With numerous milestones achieved, Megapolis continues to surpass expectations, with plans for further development and a goal to win more accolades and break more records. </p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="pro_img">
                                            <img src="images/about1.png" />
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="access">
                                <h2>Access</h2>
                                <p>As Megapolis is located in Hinjawadi Phase III, therefore it is well connected to Mumbai Pune Expressway ,Pirangut & Talegaon MIDC. This makes Megapolis an ideal choice for IT professionals who wish to avoid everyday traffic as well as enjoy the life of a serene & calm neighbourhood.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="white_back abt">
                                <div class="cstm_container">
                                    <div class="pro_park">
                                        <div class="pro_img">
                                            <img src="images/interior.png" />
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="pro_dis">
                                            <h2>Highlights and Projects</h2>
                                            <h5>We have delivered 94 towers, comprising more than 7000 units. More than 25000 people call it their home.</h5>
                                            <p>
                                               Megapolis has the following Ongoing and Completed Projects. We have a variety of configurations available in different projects - 1, 2, 2.5 and 3 BHK.
                                            </p>
                                            
                                            <ul class="detail_list">
                                                <li><b>Premium Homes</b></li>
                                                <li>Mystic (Ongoing)</li>
                                                <li>Sangria (Sold Out)</li>
                                            </ul>
                                          
                                            <ul class="detail_list">
                                                <li><b>Smart Homes</b></li>
                                                <li>Serenity (Ongoing) </li>
                                                <li>Saffron (Ongoing)</li>
                                                <li>Springs (Sold Out)</li>
                                                <li>Symphony (Sold Out)</li>
                                                <li>Splendour (Sold Out)</li>
                                                <li>Sunway (Sold Out)</li>
                                                <li>Sparklet (Sold Out)</li>
                                                <!-- <li>Megapolis Saffron   – Smart Homes VI(Ongoing Project)</li>
